# Delvers S1E03 — Raw End Of Joke Stick

**Source-identity follow-up, 2026-10-27:** The [S1E07–S1E03 batch check](../../reports/DELVERS_S1E07_S1E03_SOURCE_IDENTITY_2026-10-27.md#s1e03) verifies all comparison inputs listed in the historical report against their recorded Git blobs after CRLF-to-LF conversion only, and verifies their exact historical source paths in the recorded source commit. Raw bytes differ in line endings. This independently confirms local content correspondence with the originally pinned source revision. Earlier provenance statements remain dated history. Prior interpretive coverage, inter-ASR measurements, played cutoff and audio status are unchanged.

**Identity recovered (2026-10-24).** This is the genuine third Delvers session, published **2021-01-29**, **not** the two older uncorrected S1E03-labelled exports that actually contain S1E04. The source files used here have **`(corrected)`** in their names. [Source-identity audit](../../reports/DELVERS_S1E03_SOURCE_IDENTITY_2026-10-24.md) · [S1E04 dossier](S1E04.md). Delvers is independent of Wastes and Inverse.

**Evidence status:** Complete corrected Parakeet export read chronologically to the outro; complete Qwen Q4 and Q8 exports parsed for comparison, with selected alternate wording spot-checked (not full independent Qwen semantic reading). No original audio was listened to and MP3/SRT time alignment has not been established. All clocks below are **corrected Parakeet SRT clocks**, including initial syndicated advertisements; they must not be substituted for S1E04's different clocks.

